---
const notFit = [
  "You want a logo, a brochure site, or social media posts.",
  "You want the cheapest possible hourly rate.",
  "You want more content rather than fewer manual steps.",
  "Nobody on your side can answer questions about how the work actually runs.",
];
---

<section class="section about" id="about">
  <div class="wrap about__grid">
    <div class="about__media" data-reveal>
      <div class="portrait">
        <img
          src="/portrait.webp"
          alt="Renz Rodney Ramido"
          width="1103"
          height="1426"
          loading="lazy"
          decoding="async"
        />
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="about__body">
      <h2 data-reveal>Who you are hiring</h2>

      <p class="lede" data-reveal style="--delay:100ms">
        I am Renz Rodney Ramido. RIV is me, and that is on purpose. You talk to the person who
        builds the thing. Nothing is handed to a junior and nothing is lost between a salesperson and
        a developer.
      </p>

      <p class="lede" data-reveal style="--delay:160ms">
        I work remotely with clients across the United States, on hours that overlap the American
        working day. A broken automation gets looked at the same morning you notice it.
      </p>

      <p class="lede" data-reveal style="--delay:220ms">
        I designed and built this site myself with AI-assisted development, which is the same way I
        build everything else. Every decision on this page is one I can explain.
      </p>

      <aside class="fit" data-reveal style="--delay:280ms">
        <h3>Probably not a fit if</h3>
        <ul>
          {notFit.map((n) => <li>{n}</li>)}
        </ul>
      </aside>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .about {
    background: var(--haze);
    border-top: 1px solid var(--line);
  }

  .about__grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 0.92fr) minmax(0, 1.08fr);
    gap: clamp(32px, 5vw, 80px);
  }

  .about__media {
    position: sticky;
    top: 130px;
  }

  .portrait {
    background: var(--navy);
    border-radius: 6px;
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  .portrait img {
    width: 100%;
    height: auto;
    display: block;
  }


  .about__body {
    display: grid;
    gap: 20px;
    justify-items: start;
  }

  .fit {
    margin-top: 18px;
    padding: 26px 28px;
    background: var(--paper);
    border: 1px solid var(--line);
    border-radius: 6px;
    width: 100%;
  }

  .fit h3 {
    font-size: 1rem;
    margin-bottom: 14px;
  }

  .fit ul {
    display: grid;
    gap: 10px;
  }

  .fit li {
    font-size: 0.94rem;
    color: var(--mute);
    padding-left: 20px;
    position: relative;
  }

  .fit li::before {
    content: "";
    position: absolute;
    left: 0;
    top: 0.6em;
    width: 9px;
    height: 1px;
    background: var(--line-strong);
  }

  @media (max-width: 860px) {
    .about__grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }

    .about__media {
      position: static;
      max-width: 420px;
    }
  }
</style>
